  "translation": "A kɛra cogo min na: ni waati don a yera sanda in na masakɛ ka lajɛli yɔrɔ la, Lewidenw bolo fɛ, u ye sanu caman ye, masakɛ ka sɛbɛbaga nana, ani sarakalasebaga kunba ka ɲɛmɔgɔ, u ye ⟨את⟩ sanda so, u y'a ta, u y'a segin a yɔrɔ la. An b'ɔ kɛ cogo nin na don o don, u ye sanu labɛn ka bon.",
